1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:01,368
You slap your alarm

2
00:00:01,368 --> 00:00:02,328
in an exam hall

3
00:00:02,328 --> 00:00:04,200
in your pajamas!

4
00:00:04,230 --> 00:00:05,190
Relax,

5
00:00:05,190 --> 00:00:06,033
you're dreaming,

6
00:00:06,075 --> 00:00:06,795
and your brain

7
00:00:06,795 --> 00:00:07,475
may be running

8
00:00:07,475 --> 00:00:08,667
a fire drill.

9
00:00:08,712 --> 00:00:09,373
It rehearses

10
00:00:09,373 --> 00:00:09,911
your fears

11
00:00:09,911 --> 00:00:10,923
with the logic center

12
00:00:10,923 --> 00:00:12,033
switched off.

13
00:00:12,075 --> 00:00:12,880
Which explains

14
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:14,333
the pajamas.

15
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:15,606
In one study,

16
00:00:15,606 --> 00:00:16,702
students who dreamed

17
00:00:16,702 --> 00:00:17,894
of their exam...

18
00:00:17,894 --> 00:00:19,433
scored higher.

19
00:00:19,706 --> 00:00:20,789
Subscribe...

20
00:00:20,789 --> 00:00:22,300
it gets weirder.

21
00:00:22,330 --> 00:00:22,950
Every night,

22
00:00:22,950 --> 00:00:23,424
your brain

23
00:00:23,424 --> 00:00:24,096
paralyzes

24
00:00:24,096 --> 00:00:25,490
your arms and legs,

25
00:00:25,490 --> 00:00:26,110
so you can't

26
00:00:26,110 --> 00:00:27,467
act dreams out.

27
00:00:27,522 --> 00:00:28,082
The drill

28
00:00:28,082 --> 00:00:29,782
stays in your head.

29
00:00:29,910 --> 00:00:31,100
Usually.

